-- the room-temperature report on cyclohexane, with its warrant carried: the proposition the number rests
-- on is that the count of this compound at this condition is one, and the inhabitant of it is the
-- computation
cyh-report-300 : CReport Nat
cyh-report-300 = (cyclohexane , cyh-cond-300 , (count-of cyclohexane cyh-cond-300 ≡ 1) , cyh-count-300 , 1)
